01) Morning watch report first
- Capture the full D10 watch row before teardown mutation:
  - `SUB_2SEG` renewal #4
  - `SLT-SYN-12` Stripe probe renewal
  - Box Daily renewal #3
  - day/1 cohort final natural renewals
- Record any cancellation mails only after 118 starts; do not mix them into the pre-118 watch proof.

02) Finish card 106 / `SLT-SYN-09`
- Run its fresh D10 phase only after the morning read exists.
- Prove `SUB_2SEG` #4 and its bounded payment-success mail.
- Close 106 through review before touching 118.

03) Card 118 preflight
- Re-open the D0 baseline and Shop Access snapshot.
- Rebuild the D11/D12 keep-alive set from the current watch rows, not from memory.
- Verify the keep-alive set still includes every tail subscription expected after D10.

04) Run card 118 / `SLT-SETUP-99A`
- Restore the five baseline booleans in the admin UI.
