  - keep-alive subscriptions are still active/scheduled,
  - 109 remains closed and no one reopened it for D12-only evidence.
- Move 118 through review to `done`.

06) End-of-day D10 board rule
- Any card whose next authored work is on D11 or D12 must be back in `todo` before D10 ends.
- Do not leave watch-only work in `in-progress` overnight.

